{"id":"u-7a728258-2bb7-4de7-adcb-39936426a5ed","src":"community","title":"Nightwing","author":"Wolf","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/xjeJkD-nightwingboostcampfinal","desc":"An 8-week, 4-day upper/lower hypertrophy program built around the Nightwing physique concept from the original reel.\n\nThe program emphasizes a broad, athletic upper body through upper-chest pressing, back development, lateral delts, shoulders, and direct arm work, while maintaining balanced lower-body development through squat/leg-press patterns, Romanian deadlifts, leg extensions, leg curls, calves, adductors, and abdominal training.\n\nWeekly structure:\nUpper A → Lower 1 → Rest → Upper B → Lower 2 → Rest → Rest\n\nMost exercises use 2 hard working sets. Working sets should generally be taken to failure or very close to failure (approximately 0–1 RIR). For heavier compound movements such as squats, Romanian deadlifts, presses, and rows, stop at technical failure rather than allowing form to break down.\n\nExercise variations and setup have been standardized for consistency while retaining the structure and intent of the original program.","level":["Intermediate"],"goals":["Strength","Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":70,"joins":9,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-10-28T20:49:59.507Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Upper A","Lower 1","Upper B","Lower 2"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Row (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"lo":6,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":15,"x":2}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":20,"x":2}]},{"n":"JM Press","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":12,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Leg Press","sets":[{"lo":5,"hi":10,"x":2}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":5,